#: cache.cpp:83
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Select this if you want to verify whether the page cached in your hard disk "
"is still valid. If this is disabled, a cached copy of remote files will be "
"used whenever possible. You can still use the reload button to synchronize "
"the cache with the remote host."
