#: cache.cpp:156
msgid "C&lear Cache"
msgstr "maak skoon kas"

#: cache.cpp:159
msgid ""
"Click this button to completely clear the HTTP cache. This can be sometimes "
"useful to check if a wrong copy of a website has been cached, or to quickly "
"free some disk space."
msgstr ""
"kliek hierdie knoppie aan heeltemal maak skoon die http kas. hierdie kan "
"wees party keer bruikbare aan bevestig as 'n verkeerde kopie van 'n "
"webtuiste het al gekas, of aan vinnig vry sommige disket spasie."

#: cache.cpp:257
msgid ""
"This module lets you configure your cache settings. The cache is an internal "
"memory in Konqueror where recently read web pages are stored. If you want to "
"retrieve a web page again that you have recently read, it will not be "
"downloaded from the net, but rather retrieved from the cache which is a lot "
"faster."
msgstr ""

